## Variable Quick Reference

### HEADED Variable
```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ HEADED - Browser Visibility Control     │
├──────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Value   │ Mode      │ Speed  │ Use Case │
├─────────┼───────────┼────────┼──────────┤
│ true    │ 👁️ Headed  │ Slow   │ Debug    │
│ false   │ 🚫 Headless│ Fast   │ Automate │
│ (unset) │ 🚫 Headless│ Fast   │ Default  │
└──────────────────────────────────────────┘

Commands:
  npm run test:headed        ← true
  npm test                   ← false (default)
```

### CUCUMBER_TAGS Variable
```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ CUCUMBER_TAGS - Filter Tests by Tags              │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Expression          │ Meaning                      │
├─────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────┤
│ @smoke              │ Only @smoke tests            │
│ @smoke and @critical│ Both @smoke AND @critical    │
│ @smoke or @regression│ @smoke OR @regression tests │
│ not @wip            │ All EXCEPT @wip tests        │
│ Complex expressions │ (@tag1 or @tag2) and...    │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

Commands:
  npm run test:tags                              ← @smoke
  CUCUMBER_TAGS="@critical" npm test             ← custom
  CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke and @critical" npm test  ← complex
```

### CUCUMBER_WORKERS Variable
```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ CUCUMBER_WORKERS - Parallel Execution              │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Value │ Mode    │ Speed    │ Best System    │ Use   │
├───────┼─────────┼──────────┼────────────────┼───────┤
│ 0     │ Serial  │ 1x ⚠️    │ Any            │ Debug │
│ 2     │ Parallel│ 2x 🔆    │ 2+ CPU cores   │ Safe  │
│ 4     │ Parallel│ 3-4x ⚡  │ 4+ CPU cores   │ Good  │
│ 8     │ Parallel│ 4x 🚀    │ 8+ CPU cores   │ Fast  │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

Commands:
  npm test                                    ← 0 (serial)
  npm run test:parallel                       ← 4 workers
  CUCUMBER_WORKERS=2 npm test                 ← 2 workers
  CUCUMBER_WORKERS=8 npm test                 ← 8 workers
```

