## Tag Expression Examples

```
Single Tag:
  @smoke

Multiple (AND - both required):
  @smoke and @critical
  @regression and not @wip

Multiple (OR - either works):
  @smoke or @regression
  @ui or @api

Exclude:
  not @wip
  not @skip

Complex:
  (@smoke or @regression) and not @wip
  @critical and (@api or @ui) and not @manual
```

