## Command Construction Guide

```
Template:
  [HEADED=value] [CUCUMBER_TAGS="expression"] [CUCUMBER_WORKERS=number] npm test

Examples:
  npm test
  ↓
  HEADED=true npm test
  ↓
  CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke" npm test
  ↓
  CUCUMBER_WORKERS=4 npm test
  ↓
  HEADED=true CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke" npm test
  ↓
  HEADED=true CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke" CUCUMBER_WORKERS=4 npm test
```

