## Feature File Tags

```gherkin
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ How to Add Tags to Feature Files       │
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤

@smoke @critical
Scenario: Critical Smoke Test
  Given User navigate to Salesforce Application
  And User Login as "Admin"

@regression @wip
Scenario: Regression Test
  Given User navigate to Salesforce Application
  And perform some action

@performance
Scenario: Performance Test
  Given User navigate to Salesforce Application
  And measure performance metrics

Then run:
  CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke" npm test           ← Only @smoke
  CUCUMBER_TAGS="@regression" npm test      ← Only @regression
  CUCUMBER_TAGS="not @wip" npm test         ← Exclude @wip
  CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke and @critical" npm test ← Both
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

