## Windows Command Examples

### PowerShell
```powershell
# Single variable
$env:HEADED='true'
npm test

# Multiple variables
$env:HEADED='true'
$env:CUCUMBER_TAGS='@smoke'
$env:CUCUMBER_WORKERS='4'
npm test
```

### Command Prompt
```cmd
# Single variable
set HEADED=true
npm test

# Multiple variables
set HEADED=true
set CUCUMBER_TAGS=@smoke
set CUCUMBER_WORKERS=4
npm test
```

