## Quick Copy-Paste Commands

```bash
# Copy these directly into terminal

# See browser
npm run test:headed

# Run fast (parallel)
npm run test:parallel

# Run @smoke tests
npm run test:tags

# Run @critical tests (custom tag)
CUCUMBER_TAGS="@critical" npm test

# Run 2 workers instead of 4
CUCUMBER_WORKERS=2 npm test

# Everything combined
HEADED=true CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke" CUCUMBER_WORKERS=4 npm test

# Complex tag expression
CUCUMBER_TAGS="(@smoke or @regression) and not @wip" npm test
```

